        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Literature Notes</title>\n    <style>\n        body {\n            background-color: #f4f4f4;\n            display: flex;\n            justify-content: center;\n            align-items: center;\n            padding: 20px;\n            margin: 0;\n            font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"SimHei\", sans-serif;\n        }\n\n        .document-wrapper {\n            position: relative;\n            border: 6px solid #cc1616;\n            background-color: #ffffff;\n            width: 100%;\n            max-width: 550px;\n            padding: 12px;\n            box-sizing: border-box;\n        }\n\n        /* Decorative Corners */\n        .corner-ornament {\n            position: absolute;\n            width: 35px;\n            height: 35px;\n            background-color: #cc1616;\n            border-radius: 4px;\n            z-index: 10;\n            display: flex;\n            justify-content: center;\n            align-items: center;\n        }\n\n        .corner-ornament.top-left {\n            top: -10px;\n            left: -10px;\n        }\n\n        .corner-ornament.top-left::after {\n            content: '';\n            width: 14px;\n            height: 14px;\n            background: #fadb14;\n            border-radius: 50%;\n            box-shadow: 0 0 3px #fadb14;\n        }\n\n        .corner-ornament.bottom-right {\n            bottom: -10px;\n            right: -10px;\n        }\n\n        .corner-ornament.bottom-right::after {\n            content: '✿';\n            color: #fadb14;\n            font-size: 20px;\n            line-height: 1;\n        }\n\n        /* Inner Dashed Area */\n        .inner-dashed-box {\n            border: 1px dashed #cccccc;\n            padding: 25px 28px;\n            position: relative;\n        }\n\n        /* Inner Corner Brackets */\n        .bracket {\n            position: absolute;\n            width: 12px;\n            height: 12px;\n            border: 2px solid #e0e0e0;\n        }\n        .bracket.top-left { top: 8px; left: 8px; border-right: none; border-bottom: none; }\n        .bracket.top-right { top: 8px; right: 8px; border-left: none; border-bottom: none; }\n        .bracket.bottom-left { bottom: 8px; left: 8px; border-right: none; border-top: none; }\n        .bracket.bottom-right { bottom: 8px; right: 8px; border-left: none; border-top: none; }\n\n        /* Typography and Layout */\n        .content {\n            font-size: 16px;\n            color: #1a1a1a;\n            line-height: 1.8;\n            letter-spacing: 0.5px;\n        }\n\n        .content p {\n            margin: 0 0 6px 0;\n            text-indent: 2em;\n            text-align: justify;\n        }\n\n        .title {\n            font-size: 19px;\n            color: #5b2166;\n            margin: 10px 0 4px 0;\n            text-indent: 0;\n        }\n\n        /* Inline Text Styles */\n        .highlight-red {\n            color: #cc1616;\n            text-decoration: underline;\n            text-decoration-color: #cc1616;\n            text-decoration-thickness: 1px;\n            text-underline-offset: 3px;\n        }\n\n        .highlight-green {\n            color: #1a8f4c;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <div class=\"document-wrapper\">\n        <div class=\"corner-ornament top-left placeholder\" title=\"[Decoration: Top Left Sun]\"></div>\n        <div class=\"corner-ornament bottom-right placeholder\" title=\"[Decoration: Bottom Right Flower]\"></div>\n        \n        <div class=\"inner-dashed-box\">\n            <div class=\"bracket top-left\"></div>\n            <div class=\"bracket top-right\"></div>\n            <div class=\"bracket bottom-left\"></div>\n            <div class=\"bracket bottom-right\"></div>\n            \n            <div class=\"content\">\n                <p>艾青的诗歌《绿》运用文字的魅力用文学的形式描述了<span class=\"highlight-red\">春天到处都是绿色</span>，树木大地中的小草在春风的吹拂下来回摆动，<span class=\"highlight-red\">风是绿的，水是绿的，世界充满了绿</span>。绿是<span class=\"highlight-red\">生命</span>的颜色，是<span class=\"highlight-red\">生命</span>的象征。</p>\n                \n                <div class=\"title\">11.白桦</div>\n                <p><span class=\"highlight-green\">《白桦》</span>诗歌以白桦为中心意象，从不同角度描写它的美。白桦那么<span class=\"highlight-red\">高洁、挺拔</span>，它是<span class=\"highlight-red\">高尚人格</span>的象征。</p>\n                \n                <div class=\"title\">12.在天晴了的时候</div>\n                <p><span class=\"highlight-green\">《在天晴了的时候》</span>这是一首生动、活泼、情趣盎然的小诗，诗人以清新、优美的语言，运用<span class=\"highlight-red\">拟人</span>的手法、形象的比喻勾勒出一幅幅充满生机的画面，展现了<span class=\"highlight-red\">雨后天地间的亲切、自然、欢乐和美好，抒发了亲近自然、热爱生活的情怀。</span></p>\n                \n                <div class=\"title\">13.猫</div>\n                <p><span class=\"highlight-green\">《猫》</span>一文是著名作家<span class=\"highlight-red\">老舍</span>的作品，作者通过对猫的<span class=\"highlight-red\">古怪性格和满月小猫</span>特点的描写，抒发了对猫的<span class=\"highlight-red\">喜爱之情。</span></p>\n                \n                <div class=\"title\">14.母鸡</div>\n                <p><span class=\"highlight-green\">《母鸡》</span>一文是<span class=\"highlight-red\">老舍</span>先生脍炙人口的佳作，描写了作者对母鸡的看法的变化，表达了作者对<span class=\"highlight-red\">母爱的赞颂之情。</span>课文以<span class=\"highlight-red\">作者的情感变化为线索</span>，前后形成了<span class=\"highlight-red\">鲜明</span>的对比。前半部分写了母鸡的<span class=\"highlight-red\">无病，欺软怕硬，拼命炫耀</span>，后半部分写了母鸡的<span class=\"highlight-red\">负责，慈爱，勇敢，辛苦</span>，塑造了一位“<span class=\"highlight-red\">伟大的鸡母亲</span>”的形象。</p>\n                \n                <div class=\"title\">15.白鹅</div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</body>\n</html>"
